{
  "id": "32080_denka",
  "headword": "{電化|でんか}",
  "reading": "でんか",
  "romaji": "denka",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "electrification",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "electrification; converting to electric power",
      "explanation": "Switching something over to run on electricity: a railway line, a household, or a region. In homes, オール{電化|でんか} means using electricity for everything, with no gas supply."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "32080_denka_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{路線|ろせん}→路線：11341_rosen⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{電化|でんか}⟦された→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "The line was electrified.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32080_denka_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{新居|しんきょ}→新居：19007_shinkyo⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧オール{電化|でんか}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{住宅|じゅうたく}→住宅：03280_juutaku⟧だ。",
      "english": "Our new home is all-electric.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32080_denka_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{家庭|かてい}→家庭：12315_katei⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{電化|でんか}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{進|すす}んだ→進む：01225_susumu⟧⟦おかげ→おかげ：01362_okage⟧で、⟦{家事|かじ}→家事：12313_kaji⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦かかる→かかる：00711_kakaru⟧⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{大幅|おおはば}→大幅：12170_oohaba⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{減|へ}った→減る：01985_heru⟧。",
      "english": "Thanks to the spread of electric appliances in the home, the time spent on housework fell sharply.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- オール{電化|でんか}: all-electric (housing with no gas)\n- {電化|でんか}⟦{製品|せいひん}→製品：01445_seihin⟧: electrical appliances\n- ⟦{鉄道|てつどう}→鉄道：03550_tetsudou⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{電化|でんか}: railway electrification\n- {非電化|ひでんか}: non-electrified (of a rail line)\n\nWATCH OUT:\nHomophone of ⟦{電荷|でんか}→電荷：24378_denka⟧ (electric charge, in physics) and {殿下|でんか} (Your Highness). ⟦{電化製品|でんかせいひん}→電化製品：04906_denkaseihin⟧ is often heard simply as ⟦{家電|かでん}→家電：04966_kaden⟧.",
